    "text": "Good kebab, but honestly, I think this place is a bit overrated. The taste was good and definitely worth trying, but I wouldn’t say it was extraordinary or worth waiting forever for.\n\nThe queue was honestly a nightmare. We waited a long time, and the staff were quite slow, which made the whole experience even longer. The prices are actually reasonable considering the location and the popularity of the place.\n\nOverall, it’s a good kebab and I enjoyed it, but the hype and the extremely long queues make it feel overrated. Good food, but not worth spending a huge amount of time waiting for.",
